.TH start-cli-server-set-nut-server 1  "server "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-set\-nut\-server \- Monitor a UPS connected directly to this server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server set\-nut server\fR [\fB\-\-vendor\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-product\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-serial\fR] [\fB\-\-bus\fR] [\fB\-\-bus\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-vendor\fR] [\fB\-\-product\fR] [\fB\-\-listen\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\-username\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDRIVER\fR> <\fIPORT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Monitor a UPS connected directly to this server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-vendor\-id\fR \fI<VENDOR_ID>\fR
USB vendor ID
.TP
\fB\-\-product\-id\fR \fI<PRODUCT_ID>\fR
USB product ID
.TP
\fB\-\-serial\fR \fI<SERIAL>\fR
UPS serial number
.TP
\fB\-\-bus\fR \fI<BUS>\fR
USB bus
.TP
\fB\-\-bus\-port\fR \fI<BUS_PORT>\fR
USB port that pins a device without a serial number
.TP
\fB\-\-vendor\fR \fI<VENDOR>\fR
UPS vendor name
.TP
\fB\-\-product\fR \fI<PRODUCT>\fR
UPS product name
.TP
\fB\-\-listen\-all\fR
Serve the UPS to other NUT clients on the network
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\-username\fR \fI<REMOTE_USERNAME>\fR
Username remote NUT clients authenticate with
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDRIVER\fR>
NUT driver, as reported by nut\-scan
.TP
<\fIPORT\fR>
Device port, as reported by nut\-scan
